    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Conclusion"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Linear search is simple but inefficient for large datasets (Time Complexity: O(n))."
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Binary search is faster (Time Complexity: O(log n)) but requires sorted input."
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Both techniques are foundational for understanding advanced searching and sorting algorithms."
